%% render.orientation: portrait
flowchart TD
  A[Bearer token on REST or MCP request] --> B[TokenActor resolves application, robot, grant]
  B --> C{Application bound to a robot?}
  C -->|No| D[Acts as owner, unchanged]
  C -->|Yes| E{Live grant for this platform and community?}
  E -->|No| F[403 fail closed]
  E -->|Yes| G[Effective scopes = token scopes and grant scopes]
  G --> H[Current: robot, operator, credential community]
  H --> I[Operator permissions re-evaluated, limited to the community]
  I --> J[Resource records filtered to the community, others 404]
